          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the time came for her to give birth, there were twin boys in her womb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As she was giving birth, one of them put out his hand; so the midwife took a scarlet thread and tied it on his wrist and said, \"This one came out first.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when he drew back his hand, his brother came out, and she said, \"So this is how you have broken out!\" And he was named Perez.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then his brother, who had the scarlet thread on his wrist, came out. And he was named Zerah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
